# Getting off the jet scooter: A on nothing while riding is ObjType_Events
# 0 (loc_D9AA). The leader's copy of the position moves by
# JetScooter_CharOffPosOffsets for the way the scooter faces, and the
# walking table (loc_29B64) is asked about the scooter plus that offset.
#
# Boarded from below, the scooter faces up, over water: $171E, "We can't
# get off here!", and the box closes. Pushed down against the shore it
# turns without moving; A again is $171D and, on the next idle visit
# (loc_DA26), it parks on its own cell ($C654/$C656), jet_scooter_flag
# clears and the party comes back through ObjCL_Init on the cell below:
# 89,116, where they got on, facing up -- the leader's $2A is his $24,
# untouched while he rode. The scooter is parked again and A on it boards
# with $171C alone ($C716 is 2 now).
#
# Before build 64 there was no scooter to get on.

start slot 1 routes/saves/jet_scooter.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect object $3D hidden     # the pump (loc_5822): hidden until $C737
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle                    # riding, facing up
expect script $171C
press a
wait idle
expect script $171E          # "We can't get off here!"
shot 01_cant_get_off
press c
wait idle
press down                   # the shore: it turns, and stays put
wait idle
expect level 0 89 115
press a
wait idle
expect script $171D          # "Ok. Let's get off and walk from here."
shot 02_getting_off
press c
wait idle
expect level 0 89 116        # on foot, where they got on
shot 03_on_foot
press a                      # he faces up, at the scooter
wait idle
expect script $171C          # $C716 is 2: no note this time
shot 04_again
press c
wait idle
expect no-stderr not ported
